  "description": "Bug report: a wound row read 'Wound (5+): 1 2 3 3 5 5 \u2014 6/6' \u2014 only 2 dice beat 5+, yet 6 saves were rolled. The 6 was correct ([LETHAL HITS] from Stand Vigil: 4 critical hits auto-wounded, 2 rolled wounds) but the row hid the auto-wounds. Custodian Guard Alpha shoots the Battlewagon with [LETHAL HITS] granted via the effect_lethal_hits flag (the same flag stratagems set; Stand Vigil itself only reaches non-VEHICLE targets). Asserts the combat card's wound row splits rolled wounds from '+N Lethal Hits = total'.",
