      "comment": "RG-F1: decline the defender's reactive stratagem window only if one opened. The fixture's War Horde Orks lost the 10e 'ARD AS NAILS stopgap (Codex: Orks 11e has no War Horde stratagem in the enemy_targets_unit_shooting window), so normally none opens and resolution starts straight after CONFIRM_TARGETS.",
