      "act": "execute_script",
      "multiline": true,
      "comment": "Wound row reads 'Wound (X+): <dice> \u2014 rolled/dice +N Lethal Hits = total' with N > 0 and rolled + N == total (the seed really produced lethal auto-wounds); an automatic wound re-roll (e.g. twin-linked) may append '(re-rolled 1\u2192N)' after the total",
      "script": "var gl = tree.current_scene.game_log_panel\nvar cc = gl._card_container\nvar rows_text = []\nfor i in range(cc.get_child_count() - 1, -1, -1):\n\tvar card = cc.get_child(i)\n\tif not card.has_meta(\"combat_dice_container\"):\n\t\tcontinue\n\tfor row in card.get_meta(\"combat_dice_container\").get_children():\n\t\tvar t = \"\"\n\t\tfor c in row.get_children():\n\t\t\tif c is RichTextLabel or c is Label:\n\t\t\t\tt += gl._text_control_plain(c).strip_edges() + \" \"\n\t\trows_text.append(t.strip_edges())\n\tbreak\nvar re = RegEx.new()\nre.compile(\"^Wound \\\\(\\\\d\\\\+\\\\):.*\u2014 (\\\\d+)/(\\\\d+) \\\\+(\\\\d+) Lethal Hits = (\\\\d+)( \\\\(re-rolled [^)]*\\\\))?$\")\nfor t in rows_text:\n\tvar m = re.search(t)\n\tif m and int(m.get_string(3)) > 0 and int(m.get_string(1)) + int(m.get_string(3)) == int(m.get_string(4)):\n\t\treturn true\nreturn rows_text",
      "equals": true
    },
